*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0013
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 693
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0013.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM APPLY-INT-TIER
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-INT-TIER.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> TOP SAVINGS TIER
        WHEN ACCT-TYP EQUAL TO 'S'
           AND LEDGER-BAL >= 75000
            MOVE 0.0475 TO INT-RATE
        *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER
        WHEN ACCT-TYP = 'S' AND LEDGER-BAL >= 25000.00
            MOVE 0.0375 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN ACCT-TYP = 'S'
            MOVE 0.0300 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0100 TO INT-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
